{"about_the_game":"<strong>Habilis</strong> is a sinister-dark, 45 minute, first-person bodycam-style, Lovecraft horror game by the developer of <strong>Mother Hub</strong>.<br><br>You are an aspiring young content creator named Nathan Walters who would do anything to find fame. Once you step foot inside an old abandoned facility you face terrors and incomprehensible horror, but will it take everything from you, even your own mind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/38eea1ea11b93b667e50ef11ba0ccdb6.poster.avif?t=1759081031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/38eea1ea11b93b667e50ef11ba0ccdb6.webm?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/38eea1ea11b93b667e50ef11ba0ccdb6.mp4?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore beautifully rendered science fiction style facility in the near future.<br></li><li>A handcrafted tale of one man\u2019s descent into insanity and extreme sickness.<br></li><li>All dialogue voice acted by an all star cast of professionals.<br></li><li>Incredible, and unique music shaped to fit every scene<br></li><li>A short but sweet 45 minutes of non stop entertainment.<br></li><li>An adventure that isn\u2019t for the weak of heart.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/f1579cc4244aaf13ce418ad45134ab86.poster.avif?t=1759081031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/f1579cc4244aaf13ce418ad45134ab86.webm?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/f1579cc4244aaf13ce418ad45134ab86.mp4?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE UNKNOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An immersive adventure as Nathan Walters who would do anything for fame.<br></li><li>Try to survive as Nathan\u2019s surroundings destroy his body, and mind.<br></li><li>Hope that you might be able to escape unrelenting evils.<br></li><li>Experience a new take on the found footage / back rooms genre combined.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/45566f765228fdbf48e0e7ceb0eaa1a9.poster.avif?t=1759081031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/45566f765228fdbf48e0e7ceb0eaa1a9.webm?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/extras/45566f765228fdbf48e0e7ceb0eaa1a9.mp4?t=1759081031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE T.R.P. FACILITY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sneak, crawl, and pray that you don\u2019t get caught.<br></li><li>Only your flashlight, and your will to survive.<br></li><li>Consult your tablet for clues to solve puzzles, as well as listen to audio logs.<br></li><li>Tread carefully as the facility literally falls apart around you.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3121600?t=1759081031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3121600?t=1759081031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759081031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass